---
/** 物流の相談・問い合わせへ案内する全ページ共通CTA。 */
---
<section class="bg-sky py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="contact-cta-title">
  <div class="site-container overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-primary px-6 py-12 text-center text-white shadow-card md:px-12 md:py-16" data-reveal>
    <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-black tracking-[0.16em]">CONTACT</p>
    <h2 id="contact-cta-title" class="m-0 text-3xl font-black leading-tight md:text-5xl">物流のお悩み、ご相談ください。</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/90">輸送、配送、倉庫内作業について、ご相談・ご質問を受け付けています。</p>
    <a class="mt-8 inline-flex min-h-14 items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-white px-8 font-black text-primary no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-navy hover:text-white" href="/contact/">お問い合わせフォームへ <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
